00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Whitney Hodges: Hi, it's nice to meet you.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:39.000
Zadie Ward: Oh, sorry. No, I didn't, sorry, I was just trying to put my camera on, one second.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Take your time.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:47.000
Zadie Ward: Is that working? Yes, I think so. Hi.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes, yes.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Whitney Hodges: Hi. So nice to meet you. I'm Whitney. I'm one of the co-founders of LeadBlock.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:54.000
Zadie Ward: Hi, so sorry I'm a few minutes late.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:58.000
Whitney Hodges: No worries, it happens. I'm glad we could get on a call today.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Zadie Ward: Yeah, me too. Nice to meet you.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:11.000
Whitney Hodges: You as well. Um, so, I know you're based in the UK. Um, I'm in the US, um, in Texas. So, a little bit of a time difference for us. I hope you're having a nice evening so far.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.000
Zadie Ward: Oh, okay.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:18.000
Zadie Ward: Yes, yeah, thank you. I've got a friend in Texas, actually. I know how difficult it is to try and find time that works for both of us.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:28.000
Whitney Hodges: Good. I'm glad you found a time that was able to work for you. I'd love to hear more about what piqued your interest and motivated you to book a call for us to chat today.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:48.000
Zadie Ward: Yeah, I guess, like, I'm looking for, I guess, a system… I think that's what you guys… that I've booked in for, you know, and it's like, I think that's what I've booked in for. Yeah, I'm looking for a system, basically, to help me manage, sort of, like, inquiries and leads, as well as bookings. Like, trying to find somewhere where I can do most things in one place.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, uh-huh.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.000
