00:06:51.000 --> 00:07:13.000
Whitney Hodges: That's a big thing of what lead block helps with lead management specifically. So the ability to be able to, you know, send automated emails and text messages to every inquiry that comes in, also the ability within the system to put those leads into email nurture sequences that could kind of push them towards.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:30.000
Whitney Hodges: scheduling that vibe check call with you, if that's kind of what the next step is. Also, with Inside Lead Lock, it could take care of, like, the calendar and actually scheduling those calls to happen. I'm not sure what platform, if any, you might be using for that.

