Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:19.000
Whitney Hodges: Makes sense. And so, part of what LeadLock could do, as well, would be the email marketing. So, you could replace MailerLite, essentially, you could replace the SimplyMeet calendar system. You would probably want to continue using Studio Ninja for.

