Whitney Hodges: include right? That's all going to be captured there versus on the right hand side. We can kind of see more of like their their customer journey, like their digital history with us in terms of really where they have been coming from kind of how long it's like taken them to like flow through things. So we can see.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:59.000
Whitney Hodges: You know that for, uh, this potential client in particular, they visited their website on May 27th, just, uh, you know, a minute later, they had filmed, filled out, uh, the form, and then shortly thereafter, they ended up scheduling their appointment.

