Whitney Hodges: What also happens just a few minutes after the email was sent out is that the system automatically sends a text message as well. And so in this case, for this client, you know, they just let them know, you know, I've emailed you some more information. Do you have questions? Would you like to schedule a consultation?

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:14.000
Whitney Hodges: All of this can be customized, right, to really say whatever you'd like for…

