00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:31.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, and so from there, you know, after him getting the email and, um, the text message, he was ready to schedule a consultation. So he used that link and he went ahead and scheduled it. We can see that, uh, happened here. And then, of course, a, um, from the system.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:47.000
Whitney Hodges: you know, an email confirming the consultation also went out. And what we like to do in here is, like, we don't want it to just be, like, a surface level, your appointment is confirmed, like, see you at this day and time, right? Because that is such a crucial opportunity, like, this is going to be one of your hottest leads, right? Who's about to come in.

