Whitney Hodges: are so crucial, right? And so this is really just the initial one. Of course he's getting a text message that's confirming that appointment as well. Then let's see, he, you know, got another email leading up to the call. That's again saying, we're so excited to meet. Here are some like amazing reviews. You can check out more testimonials. So continuing to kind of like prime him.

